{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_15", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_15.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Not a bit of it, not a bit of it!", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Don't spare the dynamite!", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Because it is not merely a question of water-supply and drains now, you know.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "No\u2014it is the whole of our social life that we have got to purify and disinfect\u2014", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Spoken like a deliverer!", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "All the incapables must be turned out, you understand\u2014and that in every walk of life!", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Endless vistas have opened themselves to my mind's eye today.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "I cannot see it all quite clearly yet, but I shall in time.", "para": 3, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Young and vigorous standard-bearers\u2014those are what we need and must seek, my friends; we must have new men in command at all our outposts.", "para": 3, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Hear hear!", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "We only need to stand by one another, and it will all be perfectly easy.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "The revolution will be launched like a ship that runs smoothly off the stocks.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Don't you think so?", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "For my part I think we have now a prospect of getting the municipal authority into the hands where it should lie.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "And if only we proceed with moderation, I cannot imagine that there will be any risk.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Who the devil cares whether there is any risk or not!", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "What I am doing, I am doing in the name of truth and for the sake of my conscience.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "You are a man who deserves to be supported, Doctor.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, there is no denying that the Doctor is a true friend to the town\u2014a real friend to the community, that he is.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Take my word for it, Aslaksen, Dr. Stockmann is a friend of the people.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "I fancy the Householders' Association will make use of that expression before long.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (affected, grasps their hands).", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Thank you, thank you, my dear staunch friends.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "It is very refreshing to me to hear you say that; my brother called me something quite different.", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "By Jove, he shall have it back, with interest!", "para": 13, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "But now I must be off to see a poor devil\u2014I will come back, as I said.", "para": 13, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Keep a very careful eye on the manuscript, Aslaksen, and don't for worlds leave out any of my notes of exclamation!", "para": 13, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Rather put one or two more in!", "para": 13, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Capital, capital!", "para": 13, "sent": 7, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, good-bye for the present\u2014goodbye, goodbye!", "para": 13, "sent": 8, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "(They show him to the door, and bow him out.)", "para": 13, "sent": 9, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "He may prove an invaluably useful man to us.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, so long as he confines himself to this matter of the Baths.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "But if he goes farther afield, I don't think it would be advisable to follow him.", "para": 15, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Hm!\u2014that all depends\u2014", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "You are so infernally timid, Aslaksen!", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Timid?", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, when it is a question of the local authorities, I am timid, Mr. Billing; it is a lesson I have learned in the school of experience, let me tell you.", "para": 18, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "But try me in higher politics, in matters that concern the government itself, and then see if I am timid.", "para": 18, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "No, you aren't, I admit.", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "But this is simply contradicting yourself.", "para": 19, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "I am a man with a conscience, and that is the whole matter.", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "If you attack the government, you don't do the community any harm, anyway; those fellows pay no attention to attacks, you see\u2014they go on just as they are, in spite of them.", "para": 20, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "But local authorities are different; they can be turned out, and then perhaps you may get an ignorant lot into office who may do irreparable harm to the householders and everybody else.", "para": 20, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "But what of the education of citizens by self government\u2014don't you attach any importance to that?", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "When a man has interests of his own to protect, he cannot think of everything, Mr. Hovstad.", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Then I hope I shall never have interests of my own to protect!", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Hear, hear!", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (with a smile).", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Hm!", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "(Points to the desk.)", "para": 25, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "Mr. Sheriff Stensgaard was your predecessor at that editorial desk.", "para": 25, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing (spitting).", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Bah!", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "That turncoat.", "para": 26, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "I am not a weathercock\u2014and never will be.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "A politician should never be too certain of anything, Mr. Hovstad.", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "And as for you, Mr. Billing, I should think it is time for you to be taking in a reef or two in your sails, seeing that you are applying for the post of secretary to the Bench.", "para": 28, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "I\u2014!", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Are you, Billing?", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, yes\u2014but you must clearly understand I am only doing it to annoy the bigwigs.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Anyhow, it is no business of mine.", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "But if I am to be accused of timidity and of inconsistency in my principles, this is what I want to point out: my political past is an open book.", "para": 32, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "I have never changed, except perhaps to become a little more moderate, you see.", "para": 32, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "My heart is still with the people; but I don't deny that my reason has a certain bias towards the authorities\u2014the local ones, I mean.", "para": 32, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes into the printing room.)", "para": 32, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "Oughtn't we to try and get rid of him, Hovstad?", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you know anyone else who will advance the money for our paper and printing bill?", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "It is an infernal nuisance that we don't possess some capital to trade on.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (sitting down at his desk).", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, if we only had that, then\u2014", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Suppose you were to apply to Dr. Stockmann?", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (turning over some papers).", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "What is the use?", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "He has got nothing.", "para": 38, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "No, but he has got a warm man in the background, old Morten Kiil\u2014\"the Badger,\" as they call him.", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (writing).", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "Are you so sure he has got anything?", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "Good Lord, of course he has!", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "And some of it must come to the Stockmanns.", "para": 41, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 117, "kind": "action", "text": "Most probably he will do something for the children, at all events.", "para": 41, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 118, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (turning half round).", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 119, "kind": "action", "text": "Are you counting on that?", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 120, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 121, "kind": "action", "text": "Counting on it?", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 122, "kind": "action", "text": "Of course I am not counting on anything.", "para": 43, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 123, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 124, "kind": "action", "text": "That is right.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 125, "kind": "action", "text": "And I should not count on the secretaryship to the Bench either, if I were you; for I can assure you\u2014you won't get it.", "para": 44, "sent": 2, "present": []}]}